[{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>For each of the following graphs of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, sketch the graph of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|f(x)|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q1a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q1b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q1c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a1a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a1b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a1c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>For each of the following functions, sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|f(x)|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^2+x-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^2+7x+10\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=-x^2+2x+8\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=6+4x-2x^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+x-6=(x+3)(x-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a2a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a2b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a2c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a2d_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Each of the following graphs are curves of the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|ax^2+bx+c|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integer constants to be found. In each case find the possible value(s) of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q3a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q3b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q3c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k(x+1)(x-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=\\pm2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\pm2(x^2-2x-3)=\\pm(2x^2-4x-6),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=-6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"kx(x-5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\left(\\frac52-5\\right)=\\frac{25}{4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\pm\\left(x^2-5x\\right)=\\pm(x^2-5x),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k(x-2)^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\pm(x-2)^2=\\pm(x^2-4x+4),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>In each case, sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|f(x)|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^3-9x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^3+x^2-12x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^3-7x+6\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=14x-5x^2-x^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^3-9x=x(x-3)(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a4a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^3+x^2-12x=x(x+4)(x-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a4b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^3-7x+6=(x-1)(x-2)(x+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a4c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"14x-5x^2-x^3=-x(x+7)(x-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a4d_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Each of the following graphs are curves of the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|ax^3+bx^2+cx+d|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants to be found. In each case find the possible value(s) of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q5a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q5b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k(x+3)(2x+1)(x-5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\pm(x+3)(2x+1)(x-5)=\\pm(2x^3-3x^2-32x-15),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=-32\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=-15\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=32\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=15\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k(x+4)(3x+1)(x-2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\pm\\frac12(x+4)(3x+1)(x-2)=\\pm\\left(\\frac32x^3+\\frac72x^2-11x-4\\right),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\frac72\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=-11\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-\\frac72\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=11\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>The diagram below shows part of the curve with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=f(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q6_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|f(x)|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a6_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>In each case, sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|f(x)|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{2x+3}{x-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\dfrac{1-4x}{2x+5}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{2x+3}{x-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The asymptotes are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a7a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Consider <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\dfrac{1-4x}{2x+5}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac15\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac14\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The asymptotes are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac52\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|-2|=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a7b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>In each case, sketch <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=|f(x)|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\ln(x-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\sin x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0\\leq x\\leq2\\pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=1-\\cos x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0\\leq x\\leq2\\pi\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=1-e^x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=\\tan(2x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0\\leq x\\leq\\dfrac\\pi2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a8a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a8b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a8c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a8d_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a8e_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>In each case, by drawing a suitable sketch find the number of solutions for each of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\ln 2x|=2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|\\dfrac1x\\right|-1=x^2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\sin x|=\\dfrac2\\pi x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\cos x|=\\dfrac2\\pi x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a9a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Therefore, there is 1 solution.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a9b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Therefore, there are 2 solutions.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a9c_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Therefore, there are 2 solutions.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a9d_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Therefore, there is 1 solution.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>In each case, draw a suitable sketch to find the number of solutions for each of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\sinh x|=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2-|\\cosh x|=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a10a_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Therefore, there are 2 solutions.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/solutions/assets/diagrams/256/a10b_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<p>Therefore, there is 1 solution.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Solve each of the following:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\sinh x|=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\cosh x-2|=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh x=1\\Rightarrow x=\\ln(1+\\sqrt{1^2+1})=\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Then by symmetry, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\ln(1+\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x-2=1\\Rightarrow\\cosh x=3\\Rightarrow x=\\ln(3+\\sqrt{3^2-1})=\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Then by symmetry, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln(3-2\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Also, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\cosh x-2=-1\\Rightarrow\\cosh x=1\\Rightarrow x=\\ln(1+\\sqrt{1^2-1})=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(3+2\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\ln(3-2\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.56-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>The curve below has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{ax+b}{cx+d}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are non-zero integers. Determine the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving the values with the smallest possible integer coefficients.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.56/questions/assets/diagrams/256/q12_v01.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p>From the asymptote, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\\left(-\\frac13\\right)+d=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=\\frac c3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. From the horizontal asymptote, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\left|\\frac ac\\right|=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Take the smallest integers: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. So far, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{2x+b}{3x+1}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-intercept is 2, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times2+b=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{2x-4}{3x+1}\\right|\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Check the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-intercept: when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\left|\\dfrac{2\\times0-4}{3\\times0+1}\\right|=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as required. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]